<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Kensey Nash said cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Kensey Nash said cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney downgraded Kensey Nash Corp to neutral from buy, a source at the firm said.</p>
<p>-- Analyst not available to comment.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 5-1/8 to 9-3/4.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
